      "value": "There are already 2 bug reports about this:\n1. https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/1183-grabbing-physbones-not-visible-cross-platform\n2. https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-dynamics-reports-and-feedback/p/bug-pc-and-quest-behave-differently-when-grabbing-physbones",
